; react-day-picker@8 declares a React 16/17/18 peer, but this app runs React
; 19 (Next 16). npm 7+ treats that as a hard ERESOLVE error on a clean install
; (e.g. Vercel). react-day-picker works fine on React 19 at runtime, so fall
; back to npm 6 peer behavior here. Remove once react-day-picker is on v9+.
legacy-peer-deps=true
